{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And they shall be ready.</b> Separated from a woman (Shabbat 7)." "<b>For the third day.</b> Which is the sixth of the month, and on the fifth Moses built the altar beneath the mountain and twelve pillars — the entire matter recounted in the section ״וְאֵלֶּה הַמִּשְׁפָּטִים״ — and there is no earlier and later in the Torah." "<b>In the sight of all the people.</b> This teaches that there was no blind person among them, for all were healed (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:07.270801930Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}